"<section class=\"side-section\"><h3>Owner Time · 160 hours a month</h3><p class=\"help\">Assets earn the money, but the owner pays the attention. Spend no time and assets go cold; spend it all and stress piles up.</p>{0}{1}{2}{3}{4}{5}{6}<div class=\"button-row\"><button data-preset=\"operator\">Operator</button><button data-preset=\"investor\">Investor</button><button data-preset=\"collector\">Collector</button><button data-preset=\"leisure\">Leisure</button></div></section><section class=\"advisor\"><div class=\"advisor-avatar\">☕</div><div><b>{7}</b><p>{8}</p></div></section>":"<section class=\"side-section\"><h3>오너의 시간 · 한 달 160시간</h3><p class=\"help\">돈은 자산이 벌지만, 관심은 오너가 줍니다. 시간을 안 쓰면 자산이 식고, 다 쓰면 스트레스가 쌓입니다.</p>{0}{1}{2}{3}{4}{5}{6}<div class=\"button-row\"><button data-preset=\"operator\">경영자</button><button data-preset=\"investor\">투자자</button><button data-preset=\"collector\">컬렉터</button><button data-preset=\"leisure\">여유</button></div></section><section class=\"advisor\"><div class=\"advisor-avatar\">☕</div><div><b>{7}</b><p>{8}</p></div></section>",
