"<span class=\"eyebrow\">CHAPTER 01 · THE KEY TO MY FIRST WORKSHOP</span><h2>{0}</h2><p>From a neighbor garage to a workshop of your own. Read the clues, judge what to fix, and pick your buyer.</p><div class=\"journey-milestones\"><span>{1}/3 profitable deals</span><span>{2} / ₲350 profit</span><span>{3}</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"width:{4}%\"></i></div>{5}<div class=\"find-grid\">{6}</div><p class=\"help\">Reputation {7} · up to ₲60 added to regular and collector offers. The calendar pauses while this screen is open. Work, stocks and business run alongside it anytime.</p>{8}":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">CHAPTER 01 · 첫 작업실의 열쇠</span><h2>{0}</h2><p>지훈의 창고에서 시작해 나만의 작업실까지. 단서를 읽고, 고칠 곳을 판단하고, 손님을 골라보세요.</p><div class=\"journey-milestones\"><span>{1}/3 수익 거래</span><span>{2} / ₲350 이익</span><span>{3}</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"width:{4}%\"></i></div>{5}<div class=\"find-grid\">{6}</div><p class=\"help\">평판 {7} · 단골·수집가 제안가에 최대 ₲60 반영. 거래 화면을 열어 두면 달력이 멈춥니다. 노동·주식·사업은 언제든 병행할 수 있습니다.</p>{8}",
