"{0}<details class=\"estate-inspiration\"><summary>Architectural style image <span>{1} ＋</span></summary><figure class=\"estate-hero\"><img src=\"./city/assets/luxury/mansion-{2}.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"{3} style reference image\"><figcaption><span>{4} / PRIVATE RESIDENCE</span><h3>{5}</h3><p>{6}</p></figcaption><span class=\"estate-preview-tag\">Architectural style reference</span></figure></details>\n <div class=\"estate-specs\"><div><span>Total floor area</span><strong>{7}<small> ㎡</small></strong></div><div><span>Floors</span><strong>{8}<small> floors</small></strong></div><div><span>Private spaces</span><strong>{9}<small> rooms</small></strong></div><div><span>Exterior style</span><b>{10}</b></div></div>\n <p class=\"estate-image-note\">The rendering is a concept bird's-eye view reflecting your chosen style, height, exterior color and facilities. Layout and proportions are illustrative. You can design freely even without the cash.</p>\n <section class=\"estate-quote\" aria-label=\"Construction quote\"><div class=\"estate-quote-head\"><div><span>{11}</span><strong>{12}</strong></div><span class=\"estate-quote-seal\">DESIGNED<br>FOR YOU</span></div><div class=\"estate-quote-meta\"><span>Monthly upkeep <b>{13}</b></span><span>Cash after build <b>{14}</b></span></div><button data-action=\"mansion-build\" {15}>{16}</button><p>{17} Construction costs come out of cash and net worth; monthly upkeep is 0.4% of design value.</p></section>\n <details class=\"estate-detail\"><summary>Design summary and layout <span>View plans ＋</span></summary><div class=\"estate-design-summary\"><b>{18} · {19}</b><span>Per floor {20}㎡ · {21}</span><p>{22}</p></div>{23}{24}</details>\n <details class=\"estate-detail\"><summary>Construction cost breakdown <span>View quote ＋</span></summary><dl class=\"estate-costs\"><div><dt>Structure</dt><dd>{25}</dd></div><div><dt>Finish · roof</dt><dd>{26}</dd></div><div><dt>Facilities</dt><dd>{27}</dd></div><div><dt>Luxury facility multiplier</dt><dd>×{28}</dd></div><div><dt>New-build total</dt><dd>{29}</dd></div></dl><p class=\"help\">Each cinema, golf course, spa or helipad you add multiplies the whole quote by ×2.4. Structure costs also rise non-linearly with area, floors and room count.</p></details>":"{0}<details class=\"estate-inspiration\"><summary>건축 스타일 이미지 <span>{1} ＋</span></summary><figure class=\"estate-hero\"><img src=\"./city/assets/luxury/mansion-{2}.png\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"{3} 스타일 참고 이미지\"><figcaption><span>{4} / PRIVATE RESIDENCE</span><h3>{5}</h3><p>{6}</p></figcaption><span class=\"estate-preview-tag\">건축 스타일 참고 이미지</span></figure></details>\n <div class=\"estate-specs\"><div><span>연면적</span><strong>{7}<small> ㎡</small></strong></div><div><span>건물 층수</span><strong>{8}<small> 층</small></strong></div><div><span>나만의 공간</span><strong>{9}<small> 개 방</small></strong></div><div><span>외관 스타일</span><b>{10}</b></div></div>\n <p class=\"estate-image-note\">예상도는 선택한 스타일·층수·외벽 색상·시설을 반영한 개념 조감도입니다. 배치와 비율은 이해를 돕기 위한 표현입니다. 현금이 부족해도 자유롭게 설계할 수 있습니다.</p>\n <section class=\"estate-quote\" aria-label=\"시공 견적\"><div class=\"estate-quote-head\"><div><span>{11}</span><strong>{12}</strong></div><span class=\"estate-quote-seal\">DESIGNED<br>FOR YOU</span></div><div class=\"estate-quote-meta\"><span>월 관리비 <b>{13}</b></span><span>시공 후 현금 <b>{14}</b></span></div><button data-action=\"mansion-build\" {15}>{16}</button><p>{17} 시공비는 현금과 순자산에서 차감되며, 월 관리비는 설계 가치의 0.4%입니다.</p></section>\n <details class=\"estate-detail\"><summary>설계 요약과 공간 구성 <span>도면 보기 ＋</span></summary><div class=\"estate-design-summary\"><b>{18} · {19}</b><span>층당 {20}㎡ · {21}</span><p>{22}</p></div>{23}{24}</details>\n <details class=\"estate-detail\"><summary>시공비 상세 내역 <span>견적 보기 ＋</span></summary><dl class=\"estate-costs\"><div><dt>규모 공사비</dt><dd>{25}</dd></div><div><dt>외장·지붕</dt><dd>{26}</dd></div><div><dt>시설</dt><dd>{27}</dd></div><div><dt>고급 시설 복합 시공</dt><dd>×{28}</dd></div><div><dt>신축 기준 총액</dt><dd>{29}</dd></div></dl><p class=\"help\">영화관·골프장·스파·헬리패드는 하나 추가할 때마다 전체 견적이 ×2.4가 됩니다. 면적·층수·방 수가 커질수록 규모 공사비도 비선형으로 증가합니다.</p></details>",
