"<div class=\"mansion-studio\"><header class=\"estate-header\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE PRIVATE RESIDENCE COLLECTION</span><h2>The home you dreamed of, and a life beyond it.</h2><p>Pick your taste, fill the space. Your own mansion takes shape.</p></div><span class=\"estate-edition\">RESIDENCE<br>ATELIER <i>01 — 03</i></span></header><div class=\"estate-layout\"><div id=\"mansion-preview\" aria-live=\"polite\">{0}</div><div class=\"estate-controls\">\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>01</span> Architectural taste</legend><p>Three styles to hold your life.</p><div class=\"estate-style-options\">{1}</div></fieldset>\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>02</span> Spaces just for you</legend><div class=\"estate-amenities\">{2}</div><p class=\"estate-facility-note\">Cinema, golf, spa and helipad each multiply the whole quote by ×2.4. The quote updates as you select.</p></fieldset>\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>03</span> Room to breathe</legend><div class=\"estate-fields\">{3}<label>Area per floor (㎡)<input data-mansion=\"area\" type=\"number\" min=\"120\" max=\"10000\" step=\"10\" value=\"{4}\"></label>{5}<label>Total rooms<input data-mansion=\"rooms\" type=\"number\" min=\"2\" max=\"{6}\" step=\"1\" value=\"{7}\"></label></div><small id=\"mansion-capacity\">2–{8} at this size</small></fieldset>\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>04</span> Finishing details</legend><span class=\"estate-field-title\">Exterior color</span><div class=\"estate-swatches\">{9}</div>{10}</fieldset>\n <footer class=\"estate-controls-footer\"><button data-action=\"mansion-reset\">Reset to default design</button><p>Closing discards unapplied changes.<br>Shrinking the size adjusts rooms to fit capacity.</p></footer></div></div></div>":"<div class=\"mansion-studio\"><header class=\"estate-header\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE PRIVATE RESIDENCE COLLECTION</span><h2>당신이 꿈꾸던 집, 그 이상의 일상.</h2><p>취향을 고르고, 공간을 채우세요. 당신만의 저택이 완성됩니다.</p></div><span class=\"estate-edition\">RESIDENCE<br>ATELIER <i>01 — 03</i></span></header><div class=\"estate-layout\"><div id=\"mansion-preview\" aria-live=\"polite\">{0}</div><div class=\"estate-controls\">\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>01</span> 건축의 취향</legend><p>당신의 삶을 담을 세 가지 스타일.</p><div class=\"estate-style-options\">{1}</div></fieldset>\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>02</span> 나를 위한 특별한 공간</legend><div class=\"estate-amenities\">{2}</div><p class=\"estate-facility-note\">영화관·골프·스파·헬리패드는 추가할 때마다 전체 견적 ×2.4. 선택 즉시 견적에 반영됩니다.</p></fieldset>\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>03</span> 여유를 담는 규모</legend><div class=\"estate-fields\">{3}<label>층당 면적 (㎡)<input data-mansion=\"area\" type=\"number\" min=\"120\" max=\"10000\" step=\"10\" value=\"{4}\"></label>{5}<label>전체 방 개수<input data-mansion=\"rooms\" type=\"number\" min=\"2\" max=\"{6}\" step=\"1\" value=\"{7}\"></label></div><small id=\"mansion-capacity\">현재 규모에서 2–{8}개</small></fieldset>\n <fieldset class=\"estate-section\"><legend><span>04</span> 마감의 디테일</legend><span class=\"estate-field-title\">외벽 색상</span><div class=\"estate-swatches\">{9}</div>{10}</fieldset>\n <footer class=\"estate-controls-footer\"><button data-action=\"mansion-reset\">기본 설계로 되돌리기</button><p>닫으면 미적용 설계는 취소됩니다.<br>규모를 줄이면 방 수는 수용 범위에 맞춰 조정됩니다.</p></footer></div></div></div>",
