"<section class=\"stock-card{0}\"><h3><span class=\"stock-type type-{1}\">{2}</span><span class=\"stock-name\">{3}</span><small>₲{4}</small></h3><p class=\"stock-meta\">{5} · Market cap {6} ({7}%) · Dividend yield {8}% · {9}</p>{10}{11}{12}{13}{14}<label class=\"trade-quantity\" for=\"qty-{15}\">Quantity<input id=\"qty-{16}\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"10000000\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\"></label><div class=\"button-row\"><button data-stock=\"{17}\" data-stock-side=\"buy\">Buy</button><button data-stock-max=\"{18}\">Max</button><button data-stock=\"{19}\" data-stock-side=\"sell\" {20}>Sell</button><button data-stock=\"{21}\" data-stock-side=\"all\" {22}>Sell all</button></div></section>":"<section class=\"stock-card{0}\"><h3><span class=\"stock-type type-{1}\">{2}</span><span class=\"stock-name\">{3}</span><small>₲{4}</small></h3><p class=\"stock-meta\">{5} · 시가총액 {6} ({7}%) · 배당수익률 {8}% · {9}</p>{10}{11}{12}{13}{14}<label class=\"trade-quantity\" for=\"qty-{15}\">수량<input id=\"qty-{16}\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"10000000\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\"></label><div class=\"button-row\"><button data-stock=\"{17}\" data-stock-side=\"buy\">매수</button><button data-stock-max=\"{18}\">최대</button><button data-stock=\"{19}\" data-stock-side=\"sell\" {20}>매도</button><button data-stock=\"{21}\" data-stock-side=\"all\" {22}>전량 매도</button></div></section>",
"<p class=\"stock-alert\">⚠ Under administration · Delisted in {0} month(s) unless the price recovers above ₲{1}. Delisted shares are worth nothing.</p>":"<p class=\"stock-alert\">⚠ 관리종목 지정 · 주가가 ₲{1} 위로 회복되지 않으면 {0}개월 뒤 상장폐지됩니다. 상장폐지된 주식은 가치가 0이 됩니다.</p>",
"<span class=\"eyebrow\">VIRTUAL MARKET · {0} LISTED</span><h2>Ten companies, ten personalities.</h2><p>Growth, dividend, defensive, cyclical and speculative names, plus one new listing every year. Prices trend up over the years and plunge in a crash, and a company whose price collapses is delisted. Gains are realized when you sell, and none of this tracks a real market.</p><div class=\"investment-summary\"><div><small>Portfolio value</small><b>{1}</b></div><div><small>Unrealized P&L</small><b class=\"{2}\">{3}</b></div><div><small>Realized P&L to date</small><b>{4}</b></div><div><small>Next month dividends</small><b>{5}</b></div></div><section class=\"index-fund\"><h3>Riverside Index Fund <small>{6}{7}</small></h3>{8}<p class=\"help\">One order buys every listed company in proportion to its market cap, so the biggest names get the biggest share. Whole shares only · 0.5% fee.</p><div class=\"index-weights\">{9}</div><label class=\"trade-quantity\" for=\"index-amount\">Amount<input id=\"index-amount\" type=\"number\" min=\"1000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"100000\"></label><div class=\"button-row\"><button data-index-amount=\"100000\">₲100,000</button><button data-index-amount=\"500000\">₲500,000</button><button data-index-amount=\"1000000\">₲1,000,000</button><button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"buy-index\">Buy the index basket</button></div></section>{10}{11}{12}<p class=\"help\">0.5% trading fee · Cash on hand {13}<br>Dividends are a yield on the current price and land as cash each month. Under administration: a price below 30% of its peak starts a 3-month countdown; recovery above 40% cancels it.</p>":"<span class=\"eyebrow\">VIRTUAL MARKET · 상장 {0}개</span><h2>열 개의 기업, 열 가지 성격.</h2><p>성장주·배당주·경기방어주·경기민감주·테마주에 매년 한 곳씩 신규 상장이 더해집니다. 주가는 여러 해에 걸쳐 우상향하지만 폭락장에서는 급락하고, 주가가 무너진 기업은 상장폐지됩니다. 수익은 매도할 때 실현되며 실제 시장과는 무관합니다.</p><div class=\"investment-summary\"><div><small>보유 주식 평가액</small><b>{1}</b></div><div><small>평가손익</small><b class=\"{2}\">{3}</b></div><div><small>누적 실현손익</small><b>{4}</b></div><div><small>다음 달 배당</small><b>{5}</b></div></div><section class=\"index-fund\"><h3>리버사이드 인덱스 펀드 <small>{6}{7}</small></h3>{8}<p class=\"help\">주문 한 번으로 상장 기업 전체를 시가총액 비중대로 나눠 삽니다. 큰 기업일수록 비중이 큽니다. 정수 주식만 매수 · 수수료 0.5%.</p><div class=\"index-weights\">{9}</div><label class=\"trade-quantity\" for=\"index-amount\">금액<input id=\"index-amount\" type=\"number\" min=\"1000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"100000\"></label><div class=\"button-row\"><button data-index-amount=\"100000\">₲100,000</button><button data-index-amount=\"500000\">₲500,000</button><button data-index-amount=\"1000000\">₲1,000,000</button><button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"buy-index\">인덱스 묶음 매수</button></div></section>{10}{11}{12}<p class=\"help\">거래 수수료 0.5% · 보유 현금 {13}<br>배당은 현재 주가 대비 수익률로 매달 현금으로 들어옵니다. 관리종목: 주가가 고점의 30% 아래로 떨어지면 3개월 카운트다운이 시작되고, 40% 위로 회복하면 해제됩니다.</p>",
